WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:26.493
Mrs. Rabbit came home.

2
00:00:26.494 --> 00:00:34.450
"Where are my bunnies?" she said.

3
00:00:34.451 --> 00:00:45.846
Then she saw the empty basket.

4
00:00:45.847 --> 00:00:57.602
Mrs. Rabbit quickly hopped across the field.

5
00:00:57.603 --> 00:01:01.249
She spotted Flopsy near the trash pile.

6
00:01:01.250 --> 00:01:06.626
"Help!" cried Flopsy.

7
00:01:06.627 --> 00:01:10.382
Mrs. Rabbit and Flopsy pulled at the string.

8
00:01:10.383 --> 00:01:16.278
But it was too tight.

9
00:01:16.279 --> 00:01:24.604
"I can help!" called Mrs. Tittlemouse.

10
00:01:24.605 --> 00:01:28.728
She nibbled the string.

11
00:01:28.729 --> 00:01:36.231
And the string broke!

12
00:01:36.232 --> 00:01:39.970
"Hide your bunnies," said Mrs. Tittlemouse.

13
00:01:39.971 --> 00:01:48.729
"The farmer will be back soon!"

14
00:01:48.730 --> 00:02:06.244
Mrs. Rabbit smiled. "I have a plan."

15
00:02:06.245 --> 00:02:15.134
Soon the farmer came back for the sack.

16
00:02:15.135 --> 00:02:18.036
He brought it to his wife.

17
00:02:18.037 --> 00:02:22.225
"Three rabbits!" the farmer said.

18
00:02:22.226 --> 00:02:26.091
"We can have a special treat."

19
00:02:26.092 --> 00:02:30.116
The farmer's wife looked in the sack.

20
00:02:30.117 --> 00:02:33.985
"These aren't rabbits!" she yelled.

21
00:02:33.986 --> 00:02:39.892
"What?" The farmer looked in the sack.

22
00:02:39.893 --> 00:02:43.086
"Rotting vegetables!"

23
00:02:43.087 --> 00:02:50.274
Outside the five bunnies laughed.

24
00:02:50.275 --> 00:02:54.511
"Your plan worked, Mother," said Flopsy.

25
00:02:54.512 --> 00:02:58.678
"You tricked the farmer!" said Peter.

26
00:02:58.679 --> 00:03:03.730
Mrs. Rabbit nodded. "Come on, bunnies.

27
00:03:03.731 --> 00:03:05.739
It's time to go home."

28
00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:08.919
"Yes," said three bunnies.

29
00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:16.459
"We're hungry again!"
